OL,3,ARemember Monday 'still feel nerves'    
OL,4,Aafter Eurovision                       
OL,6,FRemember Monday used to say that       
OL,7,Frepresenting the UK at the 2025        
OL,8,FEurovision Song Contest was the        
OL,9,F"scariest" moment of their career.     
OL,11,FBut an upcoming album and UK tour will 
OL,12,Fsend the adrenaline soaring again,     
OL,13,Faccording to members Holly-Anne Hull,  
OL,14,FCharlotte Steele and Lauren Byrne.     
OL,16,F"We still feel nerves like it all the  
OL,17,Ftime," Hull told BBC Introducing.      
OL,19,FThe vocal trio have recorded a new     
OL,20,Fsession for the programme, which was   
OL,21,Fthe first to play their music on the   
OL,22,Fradio in 2019.                         
